    "title": "[EMF] Entity Model Features",
    "description": "EMF is an, OptiFine format, Custom Entity Model replacement mod available for Fabric and Forge.",
    "body": "<img src=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features/blob/master/src/main/resources/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"150\"><br>\n\n# Entity Model Features\n\n---\n\n[![discord](https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png)](https://discord.com/invite/rURmwrzUcz) ![-](https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg) [![curseforge](https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png)](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features) ![-](https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png) [![modrinth](https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png)](https://modrinth.com/mod/entity-model-features) ![-](https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png) [![github](https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png)](https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features) ![-](https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png) [![kofi](https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png)](https://ko-fi.com/traben)\n\n---\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/4I1XuqiY/images/49f5b98dfef5b073a3971750673d343e1f92efe5.png\" width=\"550\"><br>\n\n---\n\n# About\n\nEntity Model Features (EMF) is a Fabric, Forge, & NeoForge mod that adds support for OptiFine's Custom Entity Models (CEM).\n\ndesigned for anyone who wants to use CEM resource pack features but also use OptiFine alternative mods such as Sodium, Continuity or ETF.\n\n# Required Mods\n\nPlease also install the below mods if you can, the obvious ones such as Sodium are not mentioned.\n\nIt should also go without saying EMF is NOT compatible with dorianpb's CEM and OptiFine / OptiFabric.\n\n#### Required\n\n- [Entity Texture Features (ETF)](https://modrinth.com/mod/entitytexturefeatures): EMF uses several features from my other mod ETF, so it is required. (primarily used to support the random model feature, the config screen, and allow textures set in models to vary like in OptiFine)\n\n#### Highly recommended\n\n- [Entity Culling](https://modrinth.com/mod/entityculling): This mod does wonders for reducing entity rendering lag, doing even more than Sodium's included entity culling. This is very beneficial when using animation heavy packs like Fresh Animations.\n\n# Fresh Animations?\n\nYes.\n\nit works :)\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/4I1XuqiY/images/2f32dbeadc25e46ef6c56f0e47e5eb5d305c8ea2.png\" width=\"450\"><br>\n\n[Download Fresh Animations](https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/fresh-animations-v1-0/)\n\n# Features & OptiFine differences & Known Bugs\n\nUp-to-date feature details page : [Features & Optifine differences](https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features/blob/master/FEATURES.md)\n\n---\n\n# Changelog\n\nYou can find the changelog [here](https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features/blob/master/changelog.md).\n\n---\n\n# Need help or have questions?\n\nYou can reach out on my [Discord](https://discord.com/invite/rURmwrzUcz) (*preferred*) or open an issue on [GitHub](https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features).\n\n---\n\n[![discord](https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png)](https://discord.com/invite/rURmwrzUcz) ![-](https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg) [![curseforge](https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png)](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features) ![-](https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png) [![modrinth](https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png)](https://modrinth.com/mod/entity-model-features) ![-](https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png) [![github](https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png)](https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features) ![-](https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png) [![kofi](https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png)](https://ko-fi.com/traben)\n\n---\n\n## Hosting Partner deal\n\n[![image](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BVzZfTc1/images/bfb592538f8206a6a2d72d19c90714bea91b0e07.png)](https://billing.kinetichosting.com/aff.php?aff=641)\n\n",
